<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<figure xml:id="cat-c07-fig-nonpointwise">
  <caption>The indexing span and the value poset in the nonpointwise example; all unshown nonidentity arrows are absent.</caption>
  <image xml:id="cat-c07-image-nonpointwise" width="82%">
    <description><p>On the left, the indexing category is a span from the middle object b star to b zero and b one. On the right, the value category is a zigzag with arrows x to x plus, z to x plus, z to y plus, and y to y plus. This value poset has no least element.</p></description>
    <latex-image>
\begin{tikzcd}[ampersand replacement=\amp, column sep=normal, row sep=normal]
b_0 \amp b_* \arrow[l] \arrow[r] \amp b_1
\end{tikzcd}
\qquad
\begin{tikzcd}[ampersand replacement=\amp, column sep=normal, row sep=normal]
x \arrow[r] \amp x^+ \amp z \arrow[l] \arrow[r] \amp y^+ \amp y \arrow[l]
\end{tikzcd}
    </latex-image>
  </image>
</figure>